    "name": "Goblin's Gamble 24",
    "steam_appid": 3434430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/e0f91847800f19d4e35494fa37eca020.poster.avif?t=1739872193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/e0f91847800f19d4e35494fa37eca020.webm?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/e0f91847800f19d4e35494fa37eca020.mp4?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GOBLIN'S GAMBLE 24 \u2013 NO ONE IS SAFE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin's Gamble 24 is a survival game where bluffing, courage, and sudden betrayals reign. There is only one revolver on the table \u2013 but no one knows what will come out of its barrel. Every round is a surprise, and every trigger pull turns a new page of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THERE'S NO ROOM FOR COWARDS IN THIS GAME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each round, a player is randomly chosen as the Challok (the Challenger) and faces off against a rival. The other player becomes the Defok (the Defender), and both reveal their cards. Whoever has the higher hand gets control of the revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Challok wins, they can only shoot the Defok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Defok wins, they can target any player on the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware \u2013 sometimes the barrel is empty. And sometimes... it\u2019s the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin's Gamble 24 is an exciting card game that blends strategy and luck, playable online with up to 4 players. Players challenge each other each round, making high-stakes decisions to eliminate their opponents. Here are the basic rules of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/2f22e4da863b510cf830275929d21036.poster.avif?t=1739872193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/2f22e4da863b510cf830275929d21036.webm?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/2f22e4da863b510cf830275929d21036.mp4?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starting the Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is dealt 2 cards. There are two decks in play: <strong>Diamond Deck</strong> and <strong>Crown Deck</strong> (numbered 1 through 12).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player starts with 200 health.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Flow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challok Selection:</strong> A random player is chosen as the &quot;Challok&quot; (Challenger) each round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Draw:</strong> All players, except the Challok, have 20 seconds in turn to draw a card (optional, maximum 1 card) and must reveal one card onto the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge:</strong> The Challok selects an opponent, making them the &quot;Defok&quot; (Defender).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reveal Hands:</strong> Both the Challok and the Defok reveal their hands. The player with the higher total card value wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punishment:</strong> The punishment is completely random, determined by the revolver's bullets:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Potato: -20 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Tennis Ball: -40 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Marble: -60 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Firework: -80 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty: No effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Cannonball: Instant Execution, the player is eliminated from the game.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/ba29a4e0de0d6a99b2ea386abda2f833.avif?t=1739872193\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Busted Condition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player's total hand value exceeds 24, they are &quot;Busted&quot; and their hand value becomes 0.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Challok is busted, the player with the highest hand value gets to shoot the Challok.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all players are busted, the round ends with no winner, and the game proceeds to the next round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.poster.avif?t=1739872193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.webm?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.mp4?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bluffing and Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can bluff and play your cards strategically to mislead your opponents. Timing and strategy are key to securing victory!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game End</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player\u2019s health reaches 0, they are eliminated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last remaining player wins the game!</p></li></ul>",
