s=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Potato: -20 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green Tennis Ball: -40 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Marble: -60 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Firework: -80 Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty: No effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Cannonball: Instant Execution, the player is eliminated from the game.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/ba29a4e0de0d6a99b2ea386abda2f833.avif?t=1739872193\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Busted Condition</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a player's total hand value exceeds 24, they are &quot;Busted&quot; and their hand value becomes 0.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the Challok is busted, the player with the highest hand value gets to shoot the Challok.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all players are busted, the round ends with no winner, and the game proceeds to the next round.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.poster.avif?t=1739872193\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.webm?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434430/extras/0e49f399e7e5a4c184274f66a9637c7d.mp4?t=1739872193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bluffing and Strategy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><